 "amendment_reason": "The provisional null-calibration base target used the frozen synthetic law's target vector directly. That vector is scaffold-structured, and the structure survives the descriptors_permuted_across_compounds construction, making one of three nominal null families systematically non-null and biasing the pooled Q95 threshold in the permissive direction. Separately, the A3.1 specified 60/20/20 scaffold split was not realised by the inherited generator, which yields 66.7/16.7/16.7. Both are corrected prospectively, before any calibration execution.",
